Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh… why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你就有选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll give you some choices next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿回了摩托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your bike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got another one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在烧毁的森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people you met,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到的那些人抢走了你的摩托\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ones in the burnt forest, they took it from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了他们 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然受制于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still stuck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该杀了他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走你和玛姬的那伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones that took you and Maggie…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你们做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what'd they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:27.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你还没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you didn't already have plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算在牛肉干里加酸奶和蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of making my beef jerky stroganoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是上等牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not exactly a nice porterhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我保证比听起来好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I promise it's better than it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我吧 哪样我都接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me. It's good either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.69,0:07:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们算「好吧」 - 我们一起吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay is what we're doing? - We'll do dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.61,0:07:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听见你们说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的课在死巷里上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's lesson will be in the Cul-de-sac.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我们能做点别的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, can we do something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开特区后 就一直开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I got out of DC, I just drove.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得在我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember seeing it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己不知道该去哪时看到过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I realized I had no idea where I was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱迪生药品和精品店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edison's Apothecary and Boutique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是沿公路商业区的一家小礼品店\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just this little gift shop in a strip mall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果那真是药店\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if it's really an apothecary,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就有药\N{\fnArial\fs30}they had drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道药还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know they still got 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里不算远 我只是想去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't that far. I just wanna check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和罗西塔没有外出搜索补给或者轮班\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and Rosita aren't out scavenging or pulling shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面待过多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time you spend out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没待过 - 想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None. - Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能辨别药物 如今我也会用砍刀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can ID the meds. I know how to use a machete now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我近距离遭遇过行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen roamers up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你同意吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good with this? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会独自去的 假如有必要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go alone, if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会独自死在外面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在请求你确保我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to make sure I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要一个人照顾她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not babysitting her by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… the…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你也许离合松得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you're disengaging it too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我15岁就开始开手动挡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been driving stick since I was 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常开像这样的破卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}usually beat-up trucks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在之前…我离开家之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, before… you know, before I left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟教我的 所以我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother taught me, so I just know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是突然倒下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This happened fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,树腐烂了 不是人为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tree rotted out. It wasn't people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,几瓶酒 有人要喝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottles of booze. Any takers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那等下喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}For later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会把它们上交食品室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not bringing these to the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母嗜酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were kind of my parents' thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不喜欢喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why they aren't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子没办法从这树上开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck ain't gonna make it past this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 我们步行 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's walk. - Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着铁路走不用绕弯路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a straight shot if we follow the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走铁路 我们走公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tracks. We'll take the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边远了两倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's twice as far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想走哪边走哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go whichever way you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我是不会走铁路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't taking no tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该统一行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你把你那披肩长发绑起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've tied back your Tennessee waterfall there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会撒谎否认我喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lie. I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许会很想念它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may very well miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种微风吹过 长发飘飘的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feeling of the billowy curtain catching the breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某些时候可是极乐享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}some days was straight-up bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是 发型不能让男人成为男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But brass tacks… the hair doesn't make the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬汉才能让男人成为男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man makes the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,放哨 武器训练 改变发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard duty, weapons training, changing up the hairstyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着女士们显摆 自信吹牛皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}swigging some swagger with the ladies, spitting game…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连自信都没有 你就是个弱菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't spit game, you are game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎有所改变啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man seems to be changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少是在很努力地改变自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least trying like hell to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我很好奇这是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me curious what that's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在任何角色扮演游戏中\N{\fnArial\fs30}As with any RPG,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是桌游 电游 还是其他\N{\fnArial\fs30}tabletop, electronic, or otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存的关键就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}the key to survival is allowing oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自己适应相应的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be shaped by the assigned environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就会获得很多能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}In doing so, a broad range of capabilities are acquired,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让玩家可以扭转局势并且使用所谓的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}allowing one to flip the script and use said capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,反过来去塑造环境以维持最长久的生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}to shape said environment for maximum longevity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我已经处在第二阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying I'm in the process of said stage two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变了 适应了 我是一个生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed, adapted. I'm a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续骗自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变了 适应了 我是一个生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed, adapted. I've become a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意选他而不选你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to pick him over you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你握法不对 要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holding it wrong. Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, how to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是有意提起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I didn't mean to bring up…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人教了我很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people taught me a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后 他只是长名单中的一个而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years from now, he'll just be a name in a long list of names.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:29.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱迪生药品和精品店）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我和她进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, me and her are gonna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在后面 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna stay back, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准弹子锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard pin and tumbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答几下 容易得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick-tick-click, easy peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差不多该揭晓答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You about ready to spill the pintos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底来这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}on what the hell it is we're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这生产子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna manufacture bullets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑这个问题好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been chewing the cud on this for a few days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨没有弹药 我们的物资有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hilltop's dry, our supply's finite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以子弹不仅是防卫关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not only are bullets vital for defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样也适用于供求法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}but per the law of supply and demand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一盒子弹现在就是流通货币\N{\fnArial\fs30}a full cartridge is now the coin of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从零开始造子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making bullets from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用用过的弹壳 我们在里面装东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spent casings, but the innards are all us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的我们 其实就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by us, I mean me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you can do that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}With just this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是要彻底清理一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the digs will require a thorough scrubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找非常多的铅 但没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to scare up a hella ton of lead, but, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定一定以及肯定我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I most definitely almost certainly think I can do that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 那真是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, is some damn fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,超棒的开创性主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}genuine outside-the-box thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该通知瑞克 和奥利维亚谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should inform Rick, talk with Olivia,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看哪种弹药最值得生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what types of ammo would be most valuable to produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停一下 好让我解决你身后的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hit pause so I can kill that thing behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动 红毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pump your brakes, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个正式归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm formally calling dibs on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的就是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dibs is dibs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.93,0:16:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一振\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,二振\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了这个归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called dibs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.77,0:17:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有权利这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had zero authority to…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你一命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop you from dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚自己能应付得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had full control of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连坨屎都应付不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had better luck picking up a turd by its clean end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为刚说的话道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna allow you to apologize for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就给我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about you do so right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙差点把你的脸啃掉 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy down there almost ate your face, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect, screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理行尸在我的能力范围之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatching walkers is well within my skill set,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要是不同意 就去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so screw you for suggesting otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先把话说清楚 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get something straight, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,动动脑子 自制弹药这类事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using your cabeza, this whole DIY ammo thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才在你的能力范围之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is your damn skill set,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像对付敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like ghosting hostiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括行尸和活人 那是我的能力之内的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}both of the undead and the living variety, is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要真想在这个世界活得长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you truly want to survive this world long-term,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你立马认清这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you learn that posthaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:17:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从休斯顿到这一路上我都需要你的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I most certainly needed it between here and Houston.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不再需要你的保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是实话 大实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth, plain and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我已经没有用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've outlived your usefulness to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plain and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪 - 回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你都不需要我的保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己想办法回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your own way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要把早餐吐出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna find out what you had for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,燕麦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,先告诉你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:00.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（药品）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让我帮你拿包吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to hold your bags, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把药放在柜台上 我告诉你需要哪些\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you set 'em on the counter, I can tell you which.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.21,0:20:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 全都带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're gonna take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一只而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like it's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:30.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安静 安静 安静）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:17.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丹尼斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.39,0:23:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找到这个地方是好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good finding this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.69,0:23:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前就试图告诉你 你还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to tell you you weren't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.05,0:23:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.79,0:23:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比你年纪大还是小\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was he older or younger?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Older.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大我六分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}By six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.59,0:24:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯和迪尼斯这名字是我爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents came up with the Dennis/Denise thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝醉了的时候想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on one of their benders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都吓不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing scared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脾气也很暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was angry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两者的组合有点危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of a dangerous combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.64,0:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来我们的哥哥差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like we had the same brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.48,0:24:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这条路更近 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way's faster, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里有个冰箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cooler in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.01,0:26:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面可能有什么有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be something we can use inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.88,0:26:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经拿到想要的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去了 没必要费这个事 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, ain't worth the trouble, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.71,0:26:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.41,0:27:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都吐在我的眼镜上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw up on my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.95,0:28:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.67,0:28:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚闹的是哪一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.31,0:28:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会没命的 你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've died right there, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.64,0:28:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.30,0:28:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听懂了没有 - 谁他妈在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hearing me? - Who gives a shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀那些救世军时也可能会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've died killing those Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.28,0:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩都是 但你们没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}both of you, but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想活下来 就得冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna live, you take chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.07,0:28:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我刚做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.47,0:28:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了几罐破汽水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a couple of damn sodas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.79,0:28:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.15,0:28:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了这一罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的这么蠢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.94,0:28:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道 刚刚的行为对我的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any clue what that was to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整件事对我意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what this whole thing is to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.35,0:29:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受过训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I have training in this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在瞎蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not making it up as I go along,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.05,0:29:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像缝针和手术那些事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}like with the stitches and the surgery and the…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你跟我一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.13,0:29:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你跟我哥哥一样勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're brave like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.65,0:29:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时你让我觉得很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes you actually make me feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你一起来是因为你孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted you here because you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.22,0:29:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这是你这辈子第一次孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably for the first time in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也因为你比你想象中更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because you're stronger than you think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我觉得 也许我也能像你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives me hope that maybe I can be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以跟塔拉一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've gone with Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.40,0:29:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来能告诉她我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've told her I loved her,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.59,0:29:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没有 因为我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't because I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.37,0:29:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是真的蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:30:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢出来 不敢面对自己的恐惧和懦弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not coming out here, not facing my shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得更加难受的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.11,0:30:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们甚至都不需要去尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you guys aren't even trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.69,0:30:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们是那么强 那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're strong and you're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是这么好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're both really good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.85,0:30:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不醒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you don't wake…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.02,0:30:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一醒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}up…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.18,0:30:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对你们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and face your…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.80,0:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drop 'em now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.95,0:30:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有话要对我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.12,0:31:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要消除误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna clear the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.51,0:31:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续耀武扬威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step up on that high horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.25,0:31:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你话不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't talk much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.66,0:31:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在学怎么用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still getting the hang of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.73,0:31:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲劲很大 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicks like a bitch, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.61,0:31:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该下手的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should've done it. - Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我没听清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I didn't catch what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.94,0:31:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时应该杀死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.87,0:31:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你大概是该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you probably should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就来了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of begs the question, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事是谁先挑的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who brought this on who?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.98,0:32:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get that you'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么你都得听 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}just have to take my word for this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.44,0:32:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞄准的不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wasn't even the one I was aiming for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才说了 这玩意冲劲挺大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, kicks like a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是针对谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.97,0:32:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不想这样谈新生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this isn't how we like to start new business arrangements,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们这群混球先定了基调 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, well, you pricks kind of set the tone, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉亲爱的 我还不知道你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, darlin', I didn't catch your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫D 或者德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm D, or Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.81,0:32:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,两种称呼都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.69,0:32:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.06,0:32:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样 罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Rosita…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.69,0:32:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不是我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你和达里尔要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you and Daryl are going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.74,0:33:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得带我们进你们的小社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to let us into your little complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面看起来真的很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it's just beautiful in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们会让我们带走想要的任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you're going to let us take whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whoever we want…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们就爆了尤金的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we blow Eugene's brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.96,0:33:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.01,0:33:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then his.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.93,0:33:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不希望走到那一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it doesn't come to that, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都不需要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.50,0:33:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想杀一个开开场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just try and start with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.00,0:33:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证产生最大的威慑力\N{\fnArial\fs30}maximum impact to get our point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办呢 你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it gonna be? You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.21,0:33:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想杀人 先杀那边油桶后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna kill someone, you start with our companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲着的我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding over there behind the oil barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个一等一的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a first-class a-hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们三个该死多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he deserves it so much more than us three.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.33,0:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.54,0:35:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 别追了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.64,0:36:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹只是擦伤了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullet just grazed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.83,0:37:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们把他及时救了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's a good thing we got him back when we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.24,0:37:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到的抗生素可以防止他感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antibiotics we picked up could save him from an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以救他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could save his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.02,0:37:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丹妮斯的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Denise did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.55,0:37:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.91,0:37:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.30,0:37:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.44,0:37:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寻找时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.89,0:37:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.88,0:37:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为质疑我的能力道歉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you apologize for questioning my skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.31,0:37:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为质疑你的能力道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for questioning your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咬鸡鸡的本事真强 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to bite a dick, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.02,0:37:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是满怀敬意说出这话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that with the utmost of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.30,0:37:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第二阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to stage two.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.59,0:37:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用欢迎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need to welcome me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.39,0:37:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到第二阶段有阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.45,0:38:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I had choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.26,0:38:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许会在这里过三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be 30 years for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.75,0:38:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那还是不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's still too short.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.99,0:38:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.12,0:39:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.62,0:39:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的时候我就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it when you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.67,0:40:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这一切不必结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it didn't have to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.95,0:40:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不是以这种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}not this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.66,0:40:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never my intention to hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.32,0:40:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.97,0:40:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里拥有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much here…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.36,0:40:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 食物 药品 围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}people, food, medicine, walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.59,0:40:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切生存必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we need to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.06,0:40:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们有的东西 其他人也想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we have other people want, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点永远不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.13,0:40:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我们撑过了这次威胁 还是没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we survive this threat and it's not over,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.10,0:40:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人会回来 取代之前的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}another one will be back to take its place,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.82,0:40:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图夺走我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.71,0:40:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.06,0:40:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须为你们杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd have to kill for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.64,0:41:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.01,0:41:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.46,0:41:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克曾驱逐我 我本来永远不会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick sent me away and I wasn't ever gonna come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.02,0:41:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是发生了很多事 我最后留了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything happened and I wound up staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.73,0:41:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能再留下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.32,0:41:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再爱任何人 因为我不能再为任何人杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't love anyone because I can't kill for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我走了 我早该这样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm going, like I always should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.18,0:41:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come after me, please.
